      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Black's most accurate continuation, 10...Qxe7, makes the king safe immediately, easing the danger around the monarch\u2014a solid practical gain in the middlegame\u2014even though White still reaches a slight advantage (+0.28, Stockfish:16) after [pv:Qxe7 Be2 e5 Nxd5 cxd5]. Nxe7 is a roughly comparable alternative that also leads to a slight advantage for White along [pv:Nxe7 O-O h6 Ne4 b6], where White's back rank may become vulnerable further in the line.",
