      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "13.Bxe4 is the strongest and most accurate continuation, holding the balance (+0.16, Stockfish:16) along [pv:Bxe4 f5 Bd3 c5 Qb3]. White's king is now safe\u2014a worthwhile consolidation before central tension resolves with...e5. The tempting 13.g4 was clearly second-best: it gives Black a winning advantage after [pv:g4 f5 O-O-O c5 Kb1], whereas the exchange keeps White's king secure.",
