    {
      "ply": 44,
      "san": "Bg4",
      "human_san": "Bg4",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "22... f5 23. g4 Qxh4 (23... fxg4 24. Bh7+) 24. gxf5 etc.",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Black missed the potential to win a piece for a pawn and open the f-file for the rook\u2014an file that can bring heavy pieces into the attack. Instead 22...Bg4 concedes a clear advantage to White; after [pv:Bg4 Re1 f5 Nxg4 fxe4], White may win a pawn, (+0.00 \u2192 +0.77, Stockfish:16). Nd7 leads to equality [pv:Nd7 Bh7+ Kh8 Bg6 fxg6].",
      "system_symbol": "?!",
      "is_key_moment": true,
      "final_comment": true,
      "both_present": true,
      "human_only": false,
      "system_only": false,
